@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get all invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices

### Get invoice by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1

### Create invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unit": "A101",
  "due_date": "2026-08-01",
  "items": [
    {
      "description": "Common Fee",
      "amount": 1500
    },
    {
      "description": "Water Fee",
      "amount": 300
    }
  ]
}
